   "date": "2014-12-01T05:42:22Z",
   "subject": "`fill` scale of `geom_point` is not shown in the legend",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" href=\"http://i.stack.imgur.com/O3aIC.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://i.stack.imgur.com/O3aIC.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792369860687000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2v-wwkzsnl4i2lM6cXHRLq\"><img src=\"https://ci3.googleusercontent.com/proxy/7FkakU1VvCsIhown910H2UK3NbblBKR1cE3sH52HgJIj5M_Z5DI0BfiFM9KVPOzNUw66YWE=s0-d-e1-ft#http://i.stack.imgur.com/O3aIC.png\" height=\"133\" width=\"320\" border=\"0\"></a></p>My sample code is as following:<br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#008\">set</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">seed</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>df </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">frame</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">xx</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sample</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> yy</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sample</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                 type2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;a&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;b&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;a&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;a&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;b&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;b&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><code><span style=\"color:#000\">                 </span><span style=\"color:#000\"></span></code>type3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;A&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;C&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;B&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;A&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;B&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;C&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>ggplot</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">df</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> mapping </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> aes</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">xx</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> y</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">yy</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>  geom_point</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">aes</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shape</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">type3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> fill</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">type2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> size</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>  scale_shape_manual</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">values</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">24</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">25</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">21</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>  scale_fill_manual</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> values</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;green&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;red&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><br>Resulting plot has a legend but it&#39;s &#39;type2&#39; section doesn&#39;t reflect scale of <code>fill</code> value.<br>I <a href=\"http://stackoverflow.com/questions/27221011/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://stackoverflow.com/questions/27221011/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792369860687000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2C74U71HcnrN9vkkgsH3Ny\">asked on Stackoverflow and was suggested a workaround</a> which works by drawing one more layer of points, but I still don&#39;t understand why the scale is not shown natively, so I would really appreciate authors&#39; comments.<br><br><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"></p></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "1Dvxn_g_r7oJ",
   "from": "Ista Zahn",
   "author": "373beb702917b8b5",
   "date": "2014-12-01T16:23:05Z",
   "subject": "Re: `fill` scale of `geom_point` is not shown in the legend",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\">The geom used in the legend is a solid point, so it doesn&#39;t have a fill. You can force it to use another symbol, like this:</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\"><br><br>ggplot(data=df, mapping = aes(x=xx, y=yy)) +<br>  geom_point(aes(shape=type3, fill=type2), size=5) +<br>  scale_shape_manual(values=c(24,25,21)) +<br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\">  scale_fill_manual( values=c(&#39;green&#39;, &#39;red&#39;)) +<br>  guides(fill = guide_legend(override.aes = list(shape = 21)))<br><br><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\">Best,<br>Ista<br></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Mon, Dec 1, 2014 at 12:42 AM, Vasily A. <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">fgkldkgk...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" href=\"http://i.stack.imgur.com/O3aIC.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://i.stack.imgur.com/O3aIC.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792369860692000&amp;usg=AOvVaw17SvXmyJRBOJ6doI764p7x\"><img src=\"https://ci3.googleusercontent.com/proxy/7FkakU1VvCsIhown910H2UK3NbblBKR1cE3sH52HgJIj5M_Z5DI0BfiFM9KVPOzNUw66YWE=s0-d-e1-ft#http://i.stack.imgur.com/O3aIC.png\" border=\"0\" height=\"133\" width=\"320\"></a></p>My sample code is as following:<br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#008\">set</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">seed</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>df </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">frame</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">xx</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sample</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> yy</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sample</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                 type2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;a&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;b&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;a&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;a&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;b&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;b&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><code><span style=\"color:#000\">                 </span><span style=\"color:#000\"></span></code>type3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;A&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;C&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;B&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;A&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;B&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;C&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>ggplot</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">df</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> mapping </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> aes</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">xx</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> y</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">yy</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>  geom_point</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">aes</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shape</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">type3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> fill</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">type2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> size</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>  scale_shape_manual</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">values</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">24</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">25</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">21</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>  scale_fill_manual</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> values</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;green&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;red&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><br>Resulting plot has a legend but it&#39;s &#39;type2&#39; section doesn&#39;t reflect scale of <code>fill</code> value.<br>I <a href=\"http://stackoverflow.com/questions/27221011/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://stackoverflow.com/questions/27221011/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792369860692000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3D3_UR0z1XzfCrw9d01dNC\">asked on Stackoverflow and was suggested a workaround</a> which works by drawing one more layer of points, but I still don&#39;t understand why the scale is not shown natively, so I would really appreciate authors&#39; comments.<span><font color=\"#888888\"><br><br><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"></p></font></span></div></blockquote></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the ggplot2 mailing list.<br>\r\nPlease provide a reproducible example: <a href=\"https://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792369860692000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0xGqZqkpx0C0ylHUYIYiZL\">https://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility</a><br>\r\n <br>\r\nTo post: email <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a><br>\r\nTo unsubscribe: email <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggplot2+u...@googlegroups.com</a><br>\r\nMore options: <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792369860692000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2Hc5XKudNuS3WX2EHvVvLZ\">http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n--- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;ggplot2&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggplot2+u...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792369860692000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1zMQ-dMOuEGXJw6XmiRCL2\">https://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.<br>\r\n</font></span></blockquote></div><br></div>\r\n"
